### 15. Activate the bag — expect 200, "Active"
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryProducts/{{bag.response.body.data.id}}/Activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Activate the lounge — expect 200, "Active"
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryProducts/{{lounge.response.body.data.id}}/Activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Rule for the bag (35.00) — expect 200, "Draft"
# @name bagRule
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryPriceRules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}},
  "productRef": "XBAG1",
  "priority": 1,
  "currencyId": {{currencyId}},
  "lines": [ { "category": "Ancillary", "code": null, "name": null, "amount": 35.00 } ],
  "salesFrom": null, "salesTo": null, "travelFrom": null, "travelTo": null,
  "conditions": { "passengerTypes": null, "originAirportIds": null, "destinationAirportIds": null }
}

### 18. Activate it — expect 200, "Active"
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryPriceRules/{{bagRule.response.body.data.id}}/Activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

